<title>POLAND: Prochem turns to profit in Q4.</title>
<headline>Prochem turns to profit in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prochem SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating				1.44   vs    1.77 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  1.74   vs    1.26 loss</p>
<p>    net					0.94   vs    1.16 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Prochem SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     19.68   vs   13.32</p>
<p>    costs of sales			16.39   vs   13.19</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.01</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.80   vs    0.10 refund</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    investment			     2.12   vs    0.02</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating				3.36   vs    0.43 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  5.75   vs    3.42</p>
<p>    net					3.37   vs    2.08</p>
<p>    net sales			     46.01   vs   53.81</p>
<p>    costs of sales			37.86   vs   46.41</p>
